    {
      "source": "Supports Spring-style URL notation: any fully qualified standard URL\n(\"file:\", \"http:\", etc) and Spring's special \"classpath:\" pseudo-URL,\nas well as Spring's context-specific relative file paths.",
      "translation": "支持 Spring 风格的 URL 表示法：任何完全限定的标准 URL（如\"file:\"、\"http:\"等）以及 Spring 专用的\"classpath:\"伪 URL，同时支持 Spring 上下文中特定的相对文件路径。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Note: A URL must specify a valid protocol, else it will be rejected\nupfront. However, the target resource does not necessarily have to exist\nat the time of URL creation; this depends on the specific resource type.",
      "translation": "注意：URL 必须指定有效的协议，否则将在前端被直接拒绝。然而，在创建 URL 时，目标资源不一定需要存在；这取决于具体的资源类型。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
